# Data and provenance flow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Exact source artifact] --> B[Product label + terms]
  B --> C[Checksum + source lock]
  C --> D[AOI extraction]
  D --> E[CRS/datum/support normalization]
  E --> F[Quality/nodata mask]
  F --> G[Common-support aggregation]
  G --> H[Feature measurement]
  H --> I[Scenario sensitivity]
  I --> J[Comparison state]
  J --> K[Transfer-gap statement]
  K --> L[Protocol]
  A --> M[Source node]
  C --> M
  E --> N[Transform node]
  H --> O[Measurement node]
  J --> P[Claim node]
  M --> Q[Evidence edges]
  N --> Q
  O --> Q
  P --> Q
```

## Provenance invariant

For every displayed number:

```text
claim → comparison run → feature → transform → observation → exact source/version/terms
```

If a link cannot be resolved, the number is not a verified result.
